### 회원 가입 후 응답의 token 값을 아래 @token에 붙여 넣기 (이미 가입했다면 로그인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "user@example.com", "password": "password123"}

###
@token = 여기에_토큰_붙여넣기

### 상품 만들기 (위시에 담을 상품)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "콜라", "price": 1500, "imageUrl": "https://example.com/cola.png"}

### 위시 추가 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1}

### 같은 상품 다시 추가 (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1}

### 없는 상품 추가 (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 999}

### 위시 목록 조회 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 토큰 없이 조회 (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes

### 잘못된 토큰으로 조회 (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### 위시 삭제 (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 없는 위시 삭제 (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishes/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
